Third-party code
----------------
include/singlet/pileup/te_counts.h ports parts of scTE (https://github.com/JiekaiLab/scTE, commit 566f6ab3): the exclusive TE index
(bin/scTE_build genomeIndex, readGtf, cleanexon; scTE/annotation.py annoGtf), the assignment of a read to every overlapping
feature (scTE/base.py align) and the first-read-per-barcode-and-UMI molecule rule (scTE/base.py Bam2bed). scTE is described in
He J, Babarinde IA, Sun L, et al. Identifying transposable element expression dynamics and heterogeneity during development at
the single-cell level with a processing pipeline scTE. Nature Communications 12, 1456 (2021). scTE is licensed as follows:

