Method citations
----------------
The solote TE counting rule in include/singlet/pileup/te_counts.h is reimplemented from the published method of SoloTE, with no
SoloTE code: Rodriguez-Quiroz R, Valdebenito-Maturana B. SoloTE for improved analysis of transposable elements in single-cell
RNA-Seq data using locus-specific expression. Communications Biology 5, 1063 (2022).
